                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "type": "array",
                },
              ],
              "description": "key:op[:value], repeatable, ANDed. key is email, name or a custom field; op is one of eq, neq, contains, notContains, startsWith, endsWith, gt, gte, lt, lte, exists, missing. The value is everything after the second colon; gt/gte/lt/lte compare numbers when it is numeric. exists and missing take no value.",
            },
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "event",
